{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is unraveling:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dark witch Stella has torn the sacred Thread of Life, and now magic bleeds in corrupt shreds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ryn, a rag doll born from the last fragment of light, you journey through the dying heart of a withering realm. Each step reveals new horrors... and new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The five wicked dolls guard the stolen fragments. Defeat their nightmares, master their abilities, and reweave fate with the edge of your magical scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/bb42fe8d6bb21f1d04c88ca0a9292a02.poster.avif?t=1772508252\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/bb42fe8d6bb21f1d04c88ca0a9292a02.webm?t=1772508252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/bb42fe8d6bb21f1d04c88ca0a9292a02.mp4?t=1772508252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, fluid, and visceral hack-and-slash combat in constant motion. Chain light and heavy attacks, dodge with precision, and unleash powerful abilities stolen from fallen enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Time Events turn battles into cinematic showdowns that demand reflexes and reward skill. Every strike with Ryn\u2019s enchanted scissors doesn\u2019t just wound... it cuts through destiny itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/d7a79036d930757a7179b1b5ddc12fcb.poster.avif?t=1772508252\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/d7a79036d930757a7179b1b5ddc12fcb.webm?t=1772508252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/d7a79036d930757a7179b1b5ddc12fcb.mp4?t=1772508252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a 3D metroidvania-style interconnected world, where every area is filled with secrets, shortcuts, and hidden paths. Progress is unlocked by gaining new abilities after intense boss battles, allowing you to revisit previous zones and uncover what was once unreachable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/8842ca7c319177f42d63817bb7e6e083.poster.avif?t=1772508252\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/8842ca7c319177f42d63817bb7e6e083.webm?t=1772508252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/8842ca7c319177f42d63817bb7e6e083.mp4?t=1772508252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To confront the evil Witch Stella, you must first vanquish the five corrupted dolls that guard her domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hard-fought victory bestows powerful new abilities, unlocking hidden paths and forgotten realms.</p><p 